{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "1b191a20a2c8273dd7738299d08cb3cfc1c2f8ea261573744bbc742ef7ddbb3c", "ja": "魔法のメイクで大変身！", "zh": "施展化妆魔法大变身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2cb88241ca35af25ec89e48abbd9792a59ba81c577f47dade92a537db23c341b", "ja": "大人のメイク術に憧れる翼、茜、可憐は、\n風花と美希にメイクを習う。濃いメイクは\n『りるきゃん』のコンセプトに合わないと\nナチュラルメイクを教えてもらう3人。\nメイクの効果を改めて知るプロデューサー。", "zh": "翼、茜、可怜向往大人的化妆术，\n决定向风花与美希请教化妆技巧。\n由于浓艳的妆容不适合《莉露甜心》的风格，\n三人学到了自然裸妆。\n而制作人也重新体认到化妆的效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0a4e641e753555e185a3a61636db009043fe8646452edff796fd83808bc32212", "ja": "このラメ入りのパウダー、すっごくキラキラに\nなるんですね。う～、ちょっとほしいかも……。", "zh": "这款加亮片的蜜粉，扑在脸上会亮晶晶的耶。\n唔～我有点想要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "a236ea6ba9fc7b76a624182119202aef63a27cccf33e3a77664f4d7242c95f16", "ja": "わ、私はこの多色パレットのアイシャドウが気に\nなります……。ケースも、とってもカワイイ……♪", "zh": "我、我对这个多色眼影盘很有兴趣……\n它的盒子也好可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "f2f909351ee0acbb95e7ac851070804e27ee1204ec7a4ceb6ff4a3c31bda9a0c", "ja": "ただでさえカワイイ茜ちゃんが、もっとカワイく\nなっちゃったら……これはもう事件だね！", "zh": "小茜本来就很可爱了，\n要是变得更可爱……这下大事不好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6924569839394aaa7d14f4e61cf07342ee72ac75031c68043b7dc1e6ac7d964c", "ja": "おっ、3人とも、もう揃ってたんだな。\nユニットのテーマのことだけど、何かいい案は……", "zh": "哦！你们三个都来了啊。\n关于团体的主题，想出什么好点子了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5a3271e473860b3a82248dc14221db66319c90e9cb2681eb4c5dd92538c49de1", "ja": "ん？　何の雑誌を見てるんだ？", "zh": "嗯？你们在看什么杂志？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "d31a3aeeef94b30c9d515a4fbe14abfc5260a920505ef37ab44a73583ae786f2", "ja": "あ……こ、これは……莉緒さんが控室に置いていった\nファッション誌です……。大人のメイク特集で……。", "zh": "啊……这、这是……莉绪姊放在准备室的时尚杂志……\n上面有大人的化妆特辑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "f1983a60cbf5a82f91dcbe0bcd33d62b45a13f5142c6e2892728c1c4b77206cb", "ja": "大人のメイク術を体得した茜ちゃん達は、きっと\nもっとカワイくなっちゃうこと間違いなしだよ！", "zh": "小茜我们学会大人的化妆术后，\n肯定会变得更加可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a4c7721257b996cfe78cfcc6e0f8017bd205b602c0030e965c6c8a9012893240", "ja": "あ、そうだ。さっき、風花さん来てたよね。\n風花さんなら大人のメイク術、教えてくれるかも？", "zh": "啊，对了，刚才我看到风花姊有来剧场。\n风花姊也许可以教我们大人的化妆术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "920e0244bb68209bf9b9b0741295caa141246e4d367167bfbf19b2e7494b977d", "ja": "そ、そうかもしれません……！\n風花さんを探しにいきましょうか。", "zh": "有、有可能……！\n我们去找风花姊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "b82b6570bf8e77e52dd0889d6d684a912fef81fc7ab6f14370529037d052b2e3", "ja": "風花ちゃんならさっき給湯室にいたような……。\n急いで追いかけろー！", "zh": "小风花刚才好像在茶水间……\n快点追上去吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4834b538e766221b97cc18bf26f823a972fe554a7e45ce6717d3418022d443e3", "ja": "あっ、3人とも、ちょっと待て！\nユニットのテーマの件は……。", "zh": "啊！你们三个，等一下！\n团体的主题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "713d54d081d41427ae409578271476d6be5be96f2b52bb44798922fe25c1220d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nテーマとか、そういうのは後でよくない？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n主题这种事情现在不急着说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "b5af21a7582aac4207bbae63e343d41e3f4fa9033d518ec2e2d4a6f739163e87", "ja": "今は茜ちゃん達に自由にやらせて、見守るタイミング\nだと思うよ、{$P$}ちゃん。", "zh": "小茜觉得现在应该要让小茜我们自由发挥，\n小{$P$}只要在旁边看着就好啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "df74fa5ef467df1ac5bfe1a4fb191cf0f46a4af0693dda5f297154d9499307e6", "ja": "自分磨きも、た、大切だと思います……！", "zh": "我认为、提、提升自我魅力也很重要……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ac8763e2e8e85ca3a6a2fde1026b0f9122295d50ff69ba135cea8681d893b375", "ja": "えっ。可憐まで？", "zh": "咦？连可怜都这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "929d12b439d1219177ebce5a5095968851fa3bdb36c97e270d8c01f740383901", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、風花さんを見かけたら\nわたし達が呼んでたって伝えてくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，如果你有看到风花姊，\n要跟她说我们在找她喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "20a6c19047367a7c861cb23887dd35b1db4ed41debc7da246aedd5f84bf635db", "ja": "あ、ハイ……。\nじゃなくて！　3人とも、おーい！", "zh": "哦，好……\n不对！你们三个，等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7d0c0bfe0a853690d9fb22343f9847f921985c30e6b073e35b9ddecb155a0a8d", "ja": "というわけで、メイクの先生を連れてきました～♪\n風花さんと、たまたま来てた美希ちゃんです♪", "zh": "所以呢，我带了化妆老师过来啰～♪\n是风花姊和碰巧经过的美希♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "ebb0143abfaa410d59c9ef4755dc99ca3331aff8e3d85b51b690df7633aa2e17", "ja": "よろしくお願いします……！", "zh": "请多多指教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ac70fc52d8728b8ac9fe4ea201dcb976162eb1e7c4a162d956a7670260c4144", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いします♪\nと言っても、私もよくわかってないんだけど……。", "zh": "好的，请多多指教♪\n说是这么说，其实我不太清楚状况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c0b84257d2d6a110f4a7f71edd9e4ed8e47f26b64b68876033a985debce8f2c1", "ja": "えーっと、このメイク道具で、\n翼ちゃん達をメイクすればいいのかな？", "zh": "我看看，只要用这些化妆用品，\n帮小翼她们化妆就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "992894e7a93ed8ddbaf30674a15fbdc9cdab8d7b64bc8d7d52cf01f0a0f55955", "ja": "俺もあまりよくわかってないんだけど、\nそういう事みたいだな。", "zh": "其实我也搞不太清楚状况，\n但似乎就是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "a99c8c77b7f1100070db8b5dc5447ca8667745df22504fadcc30b56ff1c142f9", "ja": "あふぅ。\nそれで、ミキは何すればいいの？", "zh": "啊呼。\n那美希要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "97825a641b3c167ce362a6a1b157b11c8144132813f22f9d7e64b8142e64ea79", "ja": "美希ちゃんは、アドバイザー！　わたし達3人が\nカワイくなるためのアドバイス、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "美希是顾问！\n负责给我们三个能变可爱的建议，麻烦你了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "6a55712291274539b8ae494ea2d865a8b9e710e4eeee2549bb7269678bcacb13", "ja": "アドバイザー……よくわからないけど、わかったの。", "zh": "顾问……虽然听不太懂，但美希知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "0a894a494839eeee8357a321ed19353c98f1957a8ed78d2326c74ea10a6c6046", "ja": "それじゃあまずは、茜ちゃんが一番乗りだー！", "zh": "那么首先就由小茜打头阵──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "d8903f9a39a4890aa198c80443a6fa24af245a67902c88fe6611fc462d77b92d", "ja": "茜ちゃんにはこの色のチークが似合うと思うんだけど、\nどうかな！？　風花ちゃん、美希ちゃん！", "zh": "小茜觉得自己很适合这种颜色的腮红，\n你们觉得呢！？小风花、小美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "798e40f24fdc5294dccc81b78756f160aa2e175669fe43ef6bb49dbc6ba49fb3", "ja": "茜ちゃんの大人の魅力をアピールするために、\nがっつりメイクしちゃってね！", "zh": "小茜为了展现成人的魅力，\n化了很浓的妆喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5f58cd6f68f5c4d72e8e27e1c3f086fc17de652a191b2c0c1d2d7e06b9f2cba5", "ja": "がっつりメイク……でも茜ちゃん達、『りるきゃん』の\nイメージモデルとして、自分磨きしてるんだよね？", "zh": "浓妆……可是小茜，你们是为了担任\n《莉露甜心》的形象模特儿，才想提升魅力的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2a4670428746c293442cec1f7c23ba9db99b009e8682cc2404e278d8aedcd16", "ja": "あんまり大人っぽいメイクは、\n『りるきゃん』の雰囲気と合わないかも……。", "zh": "我觉得太成熟的妆，\n可能不太适合《莉露甜心》的风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "6703b4555eaaddc51b0dec4274220311327abc5416f6a713bf0885b00d16fa52", "ja": "うう……そ、そうでしょうか……。", "zh": "呜呜……是、是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc6dbeb27336a4c208a7afd2757793f52aea75158642e0a28c14076f4fbd80d1", "ja": "ミキも学校に行く時は、\nお仕事みたいにがっつりメイクはしてないよ。", "zh": "美希上学的时候，\n也不会化得像工作时一样浓喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ea6e73b1f5ff56784c9f78fdf3a4586706ced14e3b51947aa7bca25a70af3fbf", "ja": "えーっ！？\nじゃあ、メイクはナシってことですか！？", "zh": "什么──！？\n意思是说，我们不可以化妆吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bc477a1c3913287e8233a976dbad07b7d99aa5becf37cbcf60a47086a6707859", "ja": "しちゃいけないってことじゃなくて、翼ちゃん達には\n翼ちゃん達に合ったメイクがあるってこと。", "zh": "并不是说不可以化妆，\n而是应该有更适合小翼你们的妆容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4fddcd2b558dc9f9bf00275e559d1e114228a36314c08089235e450aac3301d4", "ja": "わたし達に合ったメイク……？", "zh": "适合我们的妆容……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c54786fd7d8b3719a996c35cc522bba61cb70d310b7b172a0a8729356caf84af", "ja": "そうだよ。\nたとえば、茜ちゃんだったら……。", "zh": "没错。\n比方说，像小茜的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "009f1dd2234eb0c0ba1902a525ac2f9dd664654dce38d84099044ac05597e4ba", "ja": "ウニャ！？", "zh": "呜喵！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "05ebc95a7a5dd7413f3e22334d2af8752a31001206e16ddd8736978d79b34b83", "ja": "やっぱり、肌がとっても綺麗！　ふふっ、うらやましい\nくらいだなぁ。ファンデーションは必要なさそう。", "zh": "我就知道，你的皮肤非常好！呵呵，真令人羡慕啊。\n看来应该不需要粉底了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a7a1cd51853e6bdfa71f03abd3fe5abdcf41da9afedf4b4918dc7a1c27aacb7", "ja": "透明感のある下地を塗ったら、パウダーを\nはたいて……。アイライナーとマスカラを……。", "zh": "涂上轻透的饰底乳，上一点蜜粉……\n再用眼线笔和睫毛膏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "372c0f0b579128a1225fab8a6b1c8f92e9c3b4b8faa842a4b97618b5d9b044f5", "ja": "ウニャー！？　か、感じる……。\n茜ちゃんがどんどん美しくなっているのを！", "zh": "呜喵──！？小、小茜感觉到了……\n小茜变得越来越美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1043_003mik", "source_sha256": "a74b2d606db25a3c33ebd08d8d8496fa04cdd5c2d03883e0a85bfcdd3e2f81eb", "ja": "わぁ。茜、いい感じなの。\nミキの香りつきリップ、つけてあげるね☆", "zh": "哇～茜的感觉很不错唷。\n帮你涂美希的香味护唇膏☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1044_003mik", "source_sha256": "e4ab3d20e3de11a2550786220b7d3535e8aa027c8e35e37f86f313c8f7af8336", "ja": "ぬりぬり……バッチリなの！", "zh": "涂涂涂……完美唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "aedc43285a5d9d0680ab45cc94b25b11d76d197a06f2e351e156b811a9e2e709", "ja": "……ん、んん……。\nど、どうかニャ？", "zh": "……嗯、嗯嗯……\n怎、怎么样喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a48133cf1ef06fb76b223b033def02baf18ec9c140f9add495ab2172dc9a51d", "ja": "かわいいー！", "zh": "好可爱──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1047_045kar", "source_sha256": "a2e215f90c29f9176245eb4170149a323479399b047baaa1e3cff5d5240e16c3", "ja": "か、かわいい……。", "zh": "好、好可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1048_016tsu", "source_sha256": "800dbd52c7afaa9dbed3108bc419ec2eded30cf8f6496074cb6f5d29c0a4259b", "ja": "茜ちゃん、すごい！　濃いメイクじゃないのに、\nすっごくカワイイよ！　なんか茜ちゃん人形みたーい！", "zh": "小茜太神奇了！妆明明不是很浓，\n却非常可爱耶！感觉好像小茜娃娃一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "ba286a380bb68edb98661787a508a299dc34f94127def04e6879ed02a13528a9", "ja": "そ、そんなにほめられると、\nさすがの茜ちゃんでも照れるニャ～。", "zh": "你、你这样子夸奖，\n就算是小茜也会害羞的喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1050_023aka", "source_sha256": "bb375074c0c3c1d1a91ff593928c70b60d4bad355d30c87ef6ccdb4f826f91e6", "ja": "……ん？　ほめたんだよね？　今の！", "zh": "……嗯？刚刚那算是夸奖吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1051_003mik", "source_sha256": "c34befb32597521a0efbb5422ed587c7065b4e23e2738b331033918523d5092e", "ja": "うまくできたみたいで、よかったの！\nこのくらいのメイクなら、学校にもしていけるよ。", "zh": "看来化得很成功呢，太好了！\n这样的妆要化去上学也没问题唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1052_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7cf02d8f1ce4c2a5c36faf92d922585842769729055817820e15dd2f6b838d1", "ja": "風花さん、美希ちゃん！\nわたしも！　わたしにもこのメイク、教えて～！", "zh": "风花姊、美希！\n我也要！也教我这种妆怎么化～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "d884c9c9727c2042f3126e5d9c794266ffabd0d668562bba18211372d83685c0", "ja": "わ、私も……教えてもらえるんでしょうか……。", "zh": "我、我也……可以请教两位吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1054_003mik", "source_sha256": "880bcec47436590bd340426082dd6c2baf591d9fe64b5c27219d69f8c75aa774", "ja": "もっちろんなの☆\n順番にしてあげるから、待っててね。", "zh": "当然可以唷☆\n照顺序来吧，等一下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1055_041fuk", "source_sha256": "470f4e74a2c5500da82f2e0dd08ac83e0044f66495d32623b1ecf897bfd424c1", "ja": "……うん、みんなすごくかわいくなったね。\n{$P$}さん、どうですか？", "zh": "……嗯，大家都变得很可爱了呢。\n{$P$}先生，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1056_p", "source_sha256": "1f6ba51e334c6c7185092184122a345d94d072dcd9e58950041d71fc8256b15a", "ja": "うん。なんだか3人の顔がキラキラしてるよ。\nメイクしているようには見えないのに、すごいな。", "zh": "嗯，感觉她们三个的脸都十分耀眼动人，\n但看起来又不像化了妆，好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1057_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1b20f4663bbc38be10a5a40b1b96245fb2dc8d05810034165ba91c8b00cb435f", "ja": "ふふっ。メイクには、見た目を変えるだけじゃなくて、\n気持ちを上げる効果もあるんです。", "zh": "呵呵！化妆不只是改变外貌，\n还有鼓舞自己的效果喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1058_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e1670775f7b62833f468d920248aa89b76c2d6e17765c1c487a274092fbf1a06", "ja": "メイクで、鏡の中の、少し違う自分と出会えて……\n可愛くなれて、うれしいんだと思います♪", "zh": "透过化妆，认识镜子里不太一样的自己……\n发现自己变可爱，我觉得是很开心的事情♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1059_p", "source_sha256": "6e67d6614a4e00ed560a811fdf69f99947b6ed4f6837c7b86643d059382f7e5a", "ja": "可愛くなれて嬉しい、か……。", "zh": "变可爱而觉得开心啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0066_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_03_1060_p", "source_sha256": "6094df9866f1ff1e5973dc360682b2d817c25ace0191c0297eaa40de3e6f5cea", "ja": "（美希と風花のメイク講座、役に立ったみたいだな。\n大事な事がわかったし、テーマはまた次回でいいか！）", "zh": "（看来美希和风花的化妆讲座很有帮助。\n而且也有了重要收获，主题就留到下次再决定吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
